{"data": {"uuid": "4e2d202e-4336-4afc-bada-fbb20450755f", "slug": "sojourn", "name": "Sojourn", "class_name": "QDRV_TARS_S02_Sojourn_SCItem", "classification": "Ship.QuantumDrive", "classification_label": "Quantum Drive", "description": {"en_EN": "When you explore a star system, it should be about the experiences, the sights, the memories. The Tarsus Sojourn quantum drive takes all the worry out of quantum travel so that you can focus on what's important, the journey.", "de_DE": "Hersteller: Tarsus\nTyp (En): Quantum Drive\nTyp (De): Quantenantrieb\n\nGr\u00f6\u00dfe: S2\nG\u00fctegrad: B\nKlasse: Civilian (Zivil)\n\nWenn Sie ein Sternensystem erkunden, sollte es um Erlebnisse, Sehensw\u00fcrdigkeiten und Erinnerungen gehen. Der Tarsus Sojourn-Quantenantrieb macht Quantenreisen zum Kinderspiel, sodass Sie sich auf das Wesentliche konzentrieren k\u00f6nnen: die Reise.", "zh_CN": "\u7269\u54c1\u7c7b\u578b\uff1a\u91cf\u5b50\u9a71\u52a8\u5668\n\u5236\u9020\u5546\uff1a\u5854\u82cf\u65af (Tarsus)\n\u5c3a\u5bf8\uff1a2\n\u7b49\u7ea7\uff1aB\n\u5206\u7c7b\uff1a\u6c11\u7528\n\n\u5f53\u60a8\u63a2\u7d22\u4e00\u4e2a\u661f\u7cfb\u65f6\uff0c\u4f60\u5e94\u8be5\u628a\u7cbe\u529b\u653e\u5728\u89c2\u5bdf\uff0c\u4f53\u9a8c\u548c\u8bb0\u5f55\u4e0a\u3002\u5854\u82cf\u65af\u7684\"\u65c5\u5c45\"\u91cf\u5b50\u9a71\u52a8\u5668\u6d88\u9664\u4e86\u91cf\u5b50\u822a\u884c\u4e2d\u7684\u6240\u6709\u70e6\u607c\uff0c\u56e0\u6b64\u60a8\u53ef\u4ee5\u628a\u7cbe\u529b\u4e13\u6ce8\u4e8e\u6700\u91cd\u8981\u7684\u65c5\u7a0b\u4e0a\u3002", "fr_FR": "Type d'objet : Propulseur quantique\nFabricant : Tarsus\nTaille : 2\nQualit\u00e9 : B\nClasse : Civile Lorsque vous explorez un syst\u00e8me stellaire, il devrait s'agir des exp\u00e9riences, des paysages et des souvenirs. Le propulseur quantique Tarsus Sojourn enl\u00e8ve tout souci li\u00e9 au voyage quantique, afin que vous puissiez vous concentrer sur l'essentiel : le voyage."}, "size": 2, "mass": 450, "event_source": [], "is_base_variant": true, "is_craftable